# `Cargo.lock` is 2752 lines of resolver output, and a feature that pulls an HTTP and
# TLS stack moves most of them. Marking it generated collapses it in GitHub's diff by
# default, so it stops burying the files a reviewer actually has to read. It stays in
# the diff and expands on request.
#
# Deliberately not `-diff`, which would treat it as binary: when a dependency moves,
# being able to see *which* one is the whole point of committing the file.
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
